#: manual/api/demo.md:1
msgid "Demo API"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/demo.md:3
msgid "The demo is the package entry point and terminal runner."
msgstr "demo は package entry point と terminal runner です。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:7
msgid "`demo_mesh(args : Array[String]) -> Mesh`: selects sphere, torus, or cube geometry."
msgstr "`demo_mesh(args : Array[String]) -> Mesh`: args から sphere、torus、cube を選択します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:8
msgid "`demo_should_rotate(args : Array[String]) -> Bool`: cube rotates by default; sphere is static by default."
msgstr "`demo_should_rotate(args : Array[String]) -> Bool`: cube は default で回転し、sphere は default で静止します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:10
msgid "`hitchcock_scene()`: central cube plus background cylinder, cone, and triangular pyramid geometry."
msgstr "`hitchcock_scene()`: central cube と background cylinder、cone、triangular pyramid geometry。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:11
msgid "`hitchcock_render_view(frame)`: camera dolly plus scientific focal-length compensation."
msgstr "`hitchcock_render_view(frame)`: camera dolly と scientific focal-length compensation。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:12
msgid "`hitchcock_frame(frame)`: renders one Hitchcock/dolly zoom frame."
msgstr "`hitchcock_frame(frame)`: Hitchcock/dolly zoom scene を 1 frame 描画します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:13
msgid "`mesh_frame(mesh, angle_x, angle_y, angle_z) -> String`: renders one frame."
msgstr "`mesh_frame(mesh, angle_x, angle_y, angle_z) -> String`: 1 frame の string を描画します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:14
msgid "`exposure_mesh_frame(mesh, angle_x, angle_y, angle_z, use_flow) -> String`: renders a pseudo long-exposure frame through `LumaBuffer`."
msgstr "`exposure_mesh_frame(mesh, angle_x, angle_y, angle_z, use_flow) -> String`: `LumaBuffer` で pseudo long-exposure frame を描画します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:16
msgid "`exposure_hitchcock_frame(frame, use_flow) -> String`: Hitchcock exposure demo."
msgstr "`exposure_hitchcock_frame(frame, use_flow) -> String`: Hitchcock exposure demo。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:17
msgid "`render_demo_image(args) -> TuiImage`: renders one static TUI image from the current demo mode."
msgstr "`render_demo_image(args) -> TuiImage`: current demo mode から static TUI image を描画します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:18
msgid "`render_demo_sequence(args, timeline) -> TuiSequence`: offline renders a playable TUI sequence."
msgstr "`render_demo_sequence(args, timeline) -> TuiSequence`: playable TUI sequence を offline render します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:19
msgid "`play_sequence(sequence, frame_limit) -> Unit`: plays frames using the sequence fps."
msgstr "`play_sequence(sequence, frame_limit) -> Unit`: sequence fps に従って character frames を再生します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:20
msgid "`render_once(mesh, angle_x, angle_y, angle_z) -> Unit`: clears the terminal and prints one frame."
msgstr "`render_once(mesh, angle_x, angle_y, angle_z) -> Unit`: terminal を clear して 1 frame を出力します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:22
msgid "`run_animation(mesh, rotate, frame_limit, exposure, use_flow, render_view) -> Unit`: runs the frame loop."
msgstr "`run_animation(mesh, rotate, frame_limit, exposure, use_flow, render_view) -> Unit`: frame loop を実行します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:23
msgid "`main`: parses `--sphere`, `--torus`, `--hitchcock`, `--dolly`, `--camera-auto`, `--long-exposure`, `--flow-exposure`, `--export-image`, `--show-image`, `--record`, `--record-stdout`, `--play`, `--duration`, `--fps`, and `--once`."
msgstr "`main`: `--sphere`、`--torus`、`--hitchcock`、`--dolly`、`--camera-auto`、`--long-exposure`、`--flow-exposure`、`--export-image`、`--show-image`、`--record`、`--record-stdout`、`--play`、`--duration`、`--fps`、`--once` を処理します。"

#: manual/api/demo.md:27
msgid "CLI"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/demo.md:51
msgid "Use `--record-stdout` for large recordings. It writes frames incrementally and avoids constructing the complete sequence in memory. Video conversion details are documented in [`tools/README.md`](../../../tools/README.md)."
msgstr "大きな recording には `--record-stdout` を使用します。frame を逐次出力するため、 sequence 全体を memory 上で構築しません。video conversion の詳細は [`tools/README.md`](../../../tools/README.md) を参照してください。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:1
msgid "Frontend API"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/frontend.md:3
msgid "The frontend package turns geometry and view state into backend-neutral draw commands."
msgstr "frontend package は geometry と view state を backend-neutral draw commands に変換します。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:7
msgid "`SceneObject`: mesh plus transform."
msgstr "`SceneObject`: mesh + transform。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:8
msgid "`Light`: directional light."
msgstr "`Light`: directional light。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:9
msgid "`Scene`: objects plus light."
msgstr "`Scene`: objects + light。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:10
msgid "`RenderView`: camera plus perspective projection."
msgstr "`RenderView`: camera + projection。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:11
msgid "`DrawTriangle`: projected triangle plus intensity."
msgstr "`DrawTriangle`: projected triangle + intensity。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:12
msgid "`DrawList`: ordered triangle commands for backends."
msgstr "`DrawList`: backend が消費する triangle command list。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:13
msgid "`ShutterSpeed`: exposure duration in seconds."
msgstr "`ShutterSpeed`: seconds 単位の shutter duration。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:14
msgid "`ExposureSettings`: shutter, frame interval, and derived sample count."
msgstr "`ExposureSettings`: shutter、frame interval、derived sample count。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:15
msgid "`LumaBuffer`: floating-point intensity buffer with depth values."
msgstr "`LumaBuffer`: depth 付き floating-point luma buffer。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:16
msgid "`FlowVector` / `FlowField`: image-space optical-flow estimate."
msgstr "`FlowVector` / `FlowField`: image-space optical flow。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:17
msgid "`Timeline`: duration and fps for deterministic offline sampling."
msgstr "`Timeline`: offline sampling 用の duration と fps。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:18
msgid "`TimelineSample`: frame index, time in seconds, and normalized progress."
msgstr "`TimelineSample`: frame index、seconds、normalized progress。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:19
msgid "`ScalarKeyframe` / `ScalarTrack`: scalar keyframes with linear interpolation."
msgstr "`ScalarKeyframe` / `ScalarTrack`: linear interpolation する scalar keyframe track。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:27
msgid "`build_draw_list(scene, render_view)`: transforms and culls geometry, builds a directional-light shadow map, and emits lit projected triangles."
msgstr "`build_draw_list(scene, render_view)`: transform、culling、directional-light shadow map、triangle lighting を実行します。"

#: manual/api/frontend.md:37
msgid "`DrawList` does not contain `Char`, `FrameBuffer`, ANSI, or terminal aspect ratio details."
msgstr "`DrawList` は `Char`、`FrameBuffer`、ANSI、terminal aspect ratio を含みません。"

