#: manual/conventions.md:1
msgid "Repository conventions"
msgstr "リポジトリ規約"

#: manual/conventions.md:3
msgid "These rules add to the Luna-Flow documentation standard for `geometry3d`."
msgstr "以下は、Luna-Flow のドキュメント標準に加えて `geometry3d` が定めるルールです。"

#: manual/conventions.md:5
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "範囲"

#: manual/conventions.md:7
msgid "Document the version on the current branch; the active baseline is **v0.5.1**."
msgstr "ドキュメントは現在のブランチ上のバージョンを説明します。現在の基準は **v0.5.1** です。"

#: manual/conventions.md:8
msgid "Do not document speculative engine features such as scene graphs, materials, textures, physics, BVH, or asset loaders unless they are implemented."
msgstr "scene graph、material、texture、physics、BVH、asset loader など未実装の engine 機能は記述しません。"

#: manual/conventions.md:11
msgid "Package boundaries"
msgstr "パッケージの境界"

#: manual/conventions.md:13
msgid "Keep geometry core documentation free of terminal, ANSI, and TUI concerns."
msgstr "geometry core の説明に terminal、ANSI、TUI の詳細を混ぜません。"

#: manual/conventions.md:14
msgid "Keep terminal y-scale, background patterns, and character rasterization under `backend/tui` or `demo`."
msgstr "terminal y-scale、background pattern、character rasterization は `backend/tui` または `demo` に記述します。"

#: manual/conventions.md:16
msgid "Keep browser DOM, Canvas, scanline, and JS-target details under `backend/canvas`, `backend/gsap`, or `demo`."
msgstr "browser DOM、Canvas、scanline、JS target の詳細は `backend/canvas`、`backend/gsap` または `demo` に記述します。"

#: manual/conventions.md:18
msgid "When behavior crosses package boundaries, update the API, design, and tutorial pages of every affected package together."
msgstr "パッケージの境界をまたぐ挙動を変更した場合は、影響を受けるすべてのパッケージの API、設計、チュートリアルのページを一緒に更新します。"

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:1
msgid "Canvas Backend Design"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:3
#: manual/design/backend/gsap.md:3
#: manual/design/backend/tui.md:3
#: manual/design/core.md:3
#: manual/design/demo.md:3
#: manual/design/frontend.md:3
#: manual/design/view.md:3
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:5
msgid "Consume the same backend-neutral `DrawList` as the TUI backend."
msgstr "TUI backend と同じ backend-neutral `DrawList` を消費します。"

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:6
msgid "Reuse the frontend perspective-correct software Z-buffer."
msgstr "frontend の perspective-correct software Z-buffer を再利用します。"

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:7
msgid "Convert visible luma values to quantized RGB shades."
msgstr "visible luma を quantized RGB shade に変換します。"

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:8
msgid "Merge adjacent equal-shade pixels into horizontal Canvas fill runs."
msgstr "同じ shade の隣接 pixel を水平 Canvas fill run に結合します。"

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:10
msgid "Boundary"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:12
msgid "The package is JS-only and owns browser Canvas details. Core, view, and frontend do not depend on DOM types. `demo_canvas` owns element lookup, animation frames, and demo selection."
msgstr "package は JS target 専用で browser Canvas の詳細を所有します。core、view、 frontend は DOM type に依存しません。element lookup、animation frame、demo selection は `demo_canvas` が所有します。"

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:16
#: manual/design/backend/tui.md:20
#: manual/design/core.md:16
#: manual/design/view.md:15
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/backend/canvas.md:18
msgid "Rendering is opaque and uses one foreground RGB color scaled by luma. There are no materials, textures, alpha blending, anti-aliasing, or GPU acceleration."
msgstr "opaque background と単一 foreground RGB color の luma scaling のみをサポートします。 material、texture、alpha blending、anti-aliasing、GPU acceleration はありません。"

#: manual/design/backend/gsap.md:1
msgid "GSAP SVG Backend Design"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/backend/gsap.md:5
msgid "Consume the backend-neutral frontend `DrawList`."
msgstr "backend-neutral frontend `DrawList` を consume します。"

#: manual/design/backend/gsap.md:6
msgid "Serialize projected triangles to reusable SVG polygon nodes."
msgstr "projected triangle を再利用可能な SVG polygon node に書き込みます。"

#: manual/design/backend/gsap.md:7
msgid "Order polygons from far to near by average depth."
msgstr "平均 depth で遠い順に並べます。"

#: manual/design/backend/gsap.md:8
msgid "Expose GSAP playback while scene math remains in MoonBit."
msgstr "scene math を MoonBit に残したまま GSAP playback を提供します。"

#: manual/design/backend/gsap.md:10
msgid "Boundary and Limitations"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/backend/gsap.md:12
msgid "The package is JS-only and requires `globalThis.gsap`. SVG uses DOM paint order, not a per-pixel Z-buffer. Intersecting triangles are not split, so occlusion can differ from Canvas. Rendering is limited to opaque flat-shaded polygons."
msgstr "package は JS-only で `globalThis.gsap` が必要です。SVG は per-pixel Z-buffer ではなく DOM paint order を使います。交差 triangle は分割されません。現在は opaque flat-shaded polygon のみを描画します。"

#: manual/design/backend/tui.md:1
msgid "Backend TUI Design"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/backend/tui.md:5
msgid "Convert projected triangles into terminal characters."
msgstr "projected triangle を terminal character に変換します。"

#: manual/design/backend/tui.md:6
msgid "Own Z-buffer, shade ramp, background pattern, and terminal y-scale correction."
msgstr "Z-buffer、shade ramp、background pattern、terminal y-scale を管理します。"

#: manual/design/backend/tui.md:7
msgid "Keep tests behavioral instead of snapshotting full ASCII frames."
msgstr "full ASCII frame snapshot ではなく behavior-based tests を優先します。"

#: manual/design/backend/tui.md:9
msgid "Pipeline"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/backend/tui.md:22
msgid "No clipping, textures, smooth normals, or anti-aliasing."
msgstr "clipping、texture、smooth normal、anti-aliasing はありません。"

#: manual/design/core.md:1
msgid "Core Design"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/core.md:5
msgid "Represent small 3D meshes using vectors from `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra`."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra` の vector を使って小さな 3D mesh を表現します。"

#: manual/design/core.md:6
msgid "Keep transforms, normals, visibility, and projection-adjacent math backend neutral."
msgstr "transform、normal、visibility などの geometry logic を backend neutral に保ちます。"

#: manual/design/core.md:7
msgid "Preserve face topology while applying transforms to vertex data."
msgstr "vertex に transform を適用し、face topology は保持します。"

#: manual/design/core.md:9
msgid "Invariants"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/core.md:11
msgid "Geometry core must not depend on `Char`, ANSI output, terminal dimensions, or background patterns."
msgstr "core は `Char`、ANSI、terminal size、background pattern に依存しません。"

#: manual/design/core.md:12
msgid "Mesh factories return vertices centered around the origin."
msgstr "mesh factory は原点中心の vertex set を返します。"

#: manual/design/core.md:13
msgid "Quad faces are the canonical mesh topology; triangulation is a helper for raster backends."
msgstr "quad face が現在の canonical topology で、triangulation は raster backend helper です。"

#: manual/design/core.md:14
msgid "Closed primitive faces use outward-facing vertex winding so normal-based culling remains valid."
msgstr "closed primitive は outward vertex winding を使い、normal-based culling を正しく保ちます。"

#: manual/design/core.md:18
msgid "No scene graph, materials, textures, clipping, camera orientation, asset loading, physics, or BVH."
msgstr "scene graph、material、texture、clipping、camera orientation、asset loading、physics、BVH はありません。"

#: manual/design/core.md:19
msgid "Sphere caps are represented as degenerate quads so the current quad pipeline can remain simple."
msgstr "sphere cap は degenerate quad で表現し、quad pipeline を単純に保ちます。"

#: manual/design/core.md:21
msgid "Extension Points"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/core.md:23
msgid "Extend `Transform3` deliberately while preserving point/direction semantics."
msgstr "`Transform3` の拡張では point と direction の semantics を維持します。"

#: manual/design/core.md:24
msgid "Add alternate mesh factories while keeping the same `Mesh` topology contract."
msgstr "`Mesh` topology contract を保ちながら mesh factory を追加できます。"

#: manual/design/core.md:25
#, fuzzy
msgid "Add non-TUI backends by consuming `Mesh`, `Transform3`, and projected vertices without changing core."
msgstr "core を変更せずに非 TUI backend を追加できます。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:1
msgid "Demo Design"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/demo.md:5
msgid "Wire the core and TUI renderer together."
msgstr "core と TUI renderer をつなぎます。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:6
msgid "Keep CLI behavior small and predictable."
msgstr "CLI behavior を小さく、予測しやすく保ちます。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:7
msgid "Demonstrate the linear algebra pipeline without adding engine-level concepts."
msgstr "engine concept を追加せず、linear algebra pipeline を示します。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:9
msgid "Defaults"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/demo.md:11
msgid "Cube: rotating, radius/half-size `1.0`."
msgstr "Cube: rotating、size `1.0`。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:12
msgid "Sphere: static, radius `2.4`, `18` rings, `36` segments."
msgstr "Sphere: static、radius `2.4`、`18` rings、`36` segments。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:13
msgid "Torus: rotating, major radius `2.1`, minor radius `0.72`, outward face winding."
msgstr "Torus: rotating、major radius `2.1`、minor radius `0.72`、outward face winding。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:14
msgid "Hitchcock: central cube plus background cylinder, cone, triangular pyramid, and rotated variants."
msgstr "Hitchcock: central cube と background cylinder、cone、triangular pyramid、その回転変体。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:15
msgid "Renderer: terminal-derived viewport with `80x32` fallback, dotted background, scientific-camera projection, and terminal y-scale `0.5`."
msgstr "Renderer: terminal-derived viewport with `80x32` fallback、dotted background、scientific-camera projection、terminal y-scale `0.5`。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:18
#: manual/design/frontend.md:15
msgid "Non-Goals"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/demo.md:20
msgid "Runtime UI, command parser, config files, or interactive controls."
msgstr "Runtime UI、複雑な command parser、config file、interactive controls。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:21
msgid "Persisted scenes or asset loading."
msgstr "Persisted scene や asset loading。"

#: manual/design/demo.md:22
msgid "Snapshot-stable ASCII art tests."
msgstr "完全な ASCII art に依存する snapshot tests。"

#: manual/design/frontend.md:1
msgid "Frontend Design"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/frontend.md:5
msgid "Own scene-level composition without owning a concrete renderer."
msgstr "scene-level composition を扱いますが、concrete renderer には依存しません。"

#: manual/design/frontend.md:6
msgid "Apply object transforms, camera transforms, projection, culling, directional lighting, and scene-wide shadow visibility."
msgstr "object transform、camera transform、projection、culling、directional lighting、scene-wide shadow visibility を編成します。"

#: manual/design/frontend.md:8
msgid "Emit compact projected triangle commands."
msgstr "compact な projected triangle commands を出力します。"

#: manual/design/frontend.md:10
msgid "Backend Boundary"
msgstr "Backend の境界"

#: manual/design/frontend.md:12
msgid "Frontend output is a `DrawList`. This is the stable boundary consumed by the current TUI and Canvas backends, and by future image or diagnostic backends."
msgstr "`DrawList` が frontend と backend の安定した境界です。現在の TUI backend と Canvas backend がこの構造を消費し、将来の image / diagnostic backend も再利用できます。"

#: manual/design/frontend.md:17
msgid "The internal shadow map is fixed-resolution and face-sampled; there is no material system, scene graph hierarchy, textures, asset loading, physics, or BVH."
msgstr "internal shadow map は fixed resolution と face sampling を使います。material system、texture、physics、BVH はありません。"

#: manual/design/view.md:1
msgid "View Design"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/view.md:5
msgid "Convert world-space points and directions into camera space."
msgstr "world-space point/direction を camera space に変換します。"

#: manual/design/view.md:6
msgid "Project camera-space points into viewport coordinates."
msgstr "camera-space point を viewport coordinates に投影します。"

#: manual/design/view.md:7
msgid "Provide backend-neutral perspective-correct depth interpolation."
msgstr "backend-neutral な perspective-correct depth interpolation を提供します。"

#: manual/design/view.md:8
msgid "Keep terminal and backend concerns outside the view package."
msgstr "terminal、ANSI、backend の詳細を含めません。"

#: manual/design/view.md:10
msgid "Conventions"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/view.md:12
msgid "Camera-space positive `z` is in front of the camera. `Camera3::look_at` builds a view transform using `right`, `true_up`, and `forward` basis vectors."
msgstr "camera space では正の `z` が camera の前方です。`Camera3::look_at` は `right`、 `true_up`、`forward` basis から view transform を作ります。"

#: manual/design/view.md:17
msgid "The first version exposes compact projection helpers instead of full clipping, near/far planes, or unprojection."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "Luna-Flow/geometry3d"
msgstr "Luna-Flow/geometry3d"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "This documentation tracks the current repository baseline for **v0.5.1**."
msgstr "このドキュメントは、現在のリポジトリ基準 **v0.5.1** を説明します。"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "The current baseline includes the Luna-Flow template-style maintenance scripts and compatibility with `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra@0.4.2`."
msgstr "現在の基準には、Luna-Flow template に揃えた maintenance script と `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra@0.4.2` 互換対応が含まれます。"

#: manual/index.md:8
msgid "Repository positioning"
msgstr "リポジトリの位置づけ"

#: manual/index.md:10
msgid "`geometry3d` is a compact MoonBit 3D geometry foundation built on `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra`. It separates core geometry, camera/view math, frontend draw-list generation, and concrete renderer backends."
msgstr "`geometry3d` は `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra` 上に構築された小さな MoonBit 3D geometry foundation です。core geometry、camera/view、frontend draw-list、 renderer backend を分離します。"

#: manual/index.md:14
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "パッケージ"

#: manual/index.md:16
msgid "Each package has an API reference, a design note and a tutorial."
msgstr "各パッケージには API リファレンス、設計ノート、チュートリアルがあります。"

#: manual/index.md:18
msgid "Package"
msgstr "パッケージ"

#: manual/index.md:18
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "内容"

#: manual/index.md:20
msgid "`Mesh`, quad faces, vector helpers, normals, visibility, and 4x4 TRS transforms."
msgstr "`Mesh`、quad face、vector helper、normal、visibility、4x4 TRS transform。"

#: manual/index.md:21
msgid "Camera, `look_at`, viewport, perspective projection, and orthographic projection."
msgstr "camera、`look_at`、viewport、perspective / orthographic projection。"

#: manual/index.md:22
msgid "`Scene`, `RenderView`, and backend-neutral `DrawList`."
msgstr "`Scene`、`RenderView`、backend-neutral `DrawList`。"

#: manual/index.md:23
msgid "TUI frame buffer, background patterns, Z-buffer, terminal y-scale, and rasterization."
msgstr "TUI frame buffer、background pattern、Z-buffer、terminal y-scale、rasterization。"

#: manual/index.md:24
msgid "Browser Canvas 2D output using the frontend software Z-buffer."
msgstr "frontend software Z-buffer を使用する browser Canvas 2D 出力。"

#: manual/index.md:25
msgid "SVG polygon output with painter ordering and GSAP playback control."
msgstr "painter ordering を使う SVG polygon output と GSAP playback control。"

#: manual/index.md:26
msgid "Terminal demos and export helpers; `demo_canvas` and `demo_gsap` provide browser demos."
msgstr "terminal demo と export helper。`demo_canvas` と `demo_gsap` は browser demo を提供します。"

#: manual/index.md:28
msgid "Guides"
msgstr "ガイド"

#: manual/index.md:30
msgid "[Migration from v0.1 to v0.2](migration_v0_2.md) maps the old single package and its TUI entry point onto the current packages."
msgstr "[v0.1 から v0.2 への移行](migration_v0_2.md) では、旧来の単一パッケージとその TUI エントリポイントが現在のどのパッケージに対応するかを説明します。"

#: manual/index.md:32
msgid "[Repository conventions](conventions.md) lists what each package's documentation may and may not cover."
msgstr "[リポジトリ規約](conventions.md) では、各パッケージのドキュメントが扱う内容と扱わない内容を示します。"

#: manual/migration_v0_2.md:1
msgid "Migration from v0.1 to v0.2"
msgstr "v0.1 から v0.2 への移行"

#: manual/migration_v0_2.md:3
msgid "`v0.2.0` is a breaking architecture release."
msgstr "`v0.2.0` は breaking architecture release です。"

#: manual/migration_v0_2.md:5
msgid "Package paths"
msgstr "パッケージパス"

#: manual/migration_v0_2.md:7
msgid "Old single package: `Luna-Flow/geometry3d`"
msgstr "旧 single package: `Luna-Flow/geometry3d`"

#: manual/migration_v0_2.md:8
msgid "New packages:"
msgstr "新 package:"

#: manual/migration_v0_2.md:15
msgid "Demo command"
msgstr "Demo コマンド"

#: manual/migration_v0_2.md:22
msgid "Rendering flow"
msgstr "レンダリングの流れ"

#: manual/migration_v0_2.md:24
msgid "The old `render_mesh(mesh, transform, config)` TUI entry point is replaced by:"
msgstr "旧 `render_mesh(mesh, transform, config)` TUI entry point は次に置き換わります。"

#: manual/migration_v0_2.md:32
msgid "Terminal y-scale moved fully into `backend/tui`."
msgstr "terminal y-scale は完全に `backend/tui` に移動しました。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/canvas.md:1
msgid "Canvas Backend Tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/backend/canvas.md:3
msgid "Build and serve the browser demo:"
msgstr "browser demo を build して起動します。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/canvas.md:9
msgid "Open `http://localhost:8080` and use the selector to switch between Torus and Dolly zoom. The build output is written to `target/canvas-demo`."
msgstr "`http://localhost:8080` を開き、selector で Torus と Dolly zoom を切り替えます。 build output は `target/canvas-demo` に作成されます。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/canvas.md:12
msgid "For application code, obtain a `CanvasRenderingContext2D` with `moonbit-community/rabbita/dom`, build a frontend draw list, and call `render_draw_list`. Use `render_scene` when the backend should build the draw list from a `Scene` and `RenderView`."
msgstr "application code では `moonbit-community/rabbita/dom` から `CanvasRenderingContext2D` を取得し、frontend draw list を作成して `render_draw_list` を呼びます。`Scene` と `RenderView` から描画する場合は `render_scene` を使用します。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/gsap.md:1
msgid "GSAP SVG Backend Tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/backend/gsap.md:7
msgid "Open `http://localhost:8081`. The demo loads pinned GSAP ESM, assigns it to `globalThis.gsap`, and then loads the MoonBit output."
msgstr "`http://localhost:8081` を開きます。demo は固定 version の GSAP ESM を読み込み、 `globalThis.gsap` を設定してから MoonBit output を読み込みます。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/gsap.md:10
msgid "Pass an SVG element and frontend `DrawList` to `render_draw_list`. For animation, create `GsapPlayer` and rebuild the scene from the seconds supplied to its frame callback. Call `kill` when the owning page or component is disposed."
msgstr "SVG element と frontend `DrawList` を `render_draw_list` に渡します。animation は `GsapPlayer` の frame callback に渡される秒から scene を再構築します。破棄時には `kill` を呼びます。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/tui.md:1
msgid "Backend TUI Tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/backend/tui.md:10
msgid "Use `TuiRenderConfig::sized(width, height)` when dimensions come from the current terminal."
msgstr "current terminal dimensions を使う場合は `TuiRenderConfig::sized(width, height)` を選びます。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/tui.md:12
msgid "To change the background:"
msgstr "background を差し替える:"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/tui.md:18
msgid "`terminal_y_scale` belongs to this backend because it compensates for terminal cell shape rather than geometry or camera math."
msgstr "`terminal_y_scale` は terminal cell shape の補正なので、geometry や camera math ではなく TUI backend に属します。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:1
msgid "Core Tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:3
msgid "Build A Mesh"
msgstr "Mesh を作る"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:11
msgid "Both meshes use `@la.Vector[Double]` vertices and `QuadFace` topology."
msgstr "どちらも `@la.Vector[Double]` vertices と `QuadFace` topology を使います。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:13
msgid "Transform A Mesh"
msgstr "Mesh を変換する"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:20
msgid "`Transform3` also provides translation, non-uniform scale, and composition."
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:22
msgid "The transform layer uses `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra` matrix construction, matrix multiplication, and `mul_vec`."
msgstr "transform layer は `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra` の matrix construction、 matrix multiplication、`mul_vec` を使います。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:25
msgid "Inspect Face Geometry"
msgstr "Face Geometry を見る"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:34
msgid "Use these helpers before projection or rendering. They are independent of any screen size or backend."
msgstr "これらの helper は projection や rendering の前に使います。screen size や backend には依存しません。"

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:1
msgid "Demo Tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:3
msgid "Rotating Cube"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:9
msgid "The default demo renders a rotating cube with dotted background, Z-buffering, backface culling, flat lighting, and terminal y-scale correction."
msgstr "default demo は dotted background、Z-buffer、backface culling、flat lighting、 terminal y-scale correction を使って rotating cube を描画します。"

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:12
msgid "Static Sphere"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:18
msgid "The sphere demo uses a higher-subdivision UV sphere and remains static so the faceted lighting is easy to inspect."
msgstr "sphere demo は高めの subdivision の UV sphere を使い、lighting を見やすくするため静止します。"

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:21
msgid "Rotating Torus"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:27
msgid "The torus uses outward face winding so backface culling shows the exterior rather than the inner wall. `just` also forwards the detected terminal dimensions."
msgstr "torus は outward face winding を使うため、backface culling は inner wall ではなく exterior を表示します。`just` は detected terminal dimensions も渡します。"

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:30
msgid "Hitchcock Zoom Scene"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:36
msgid "This scene keeps a central cube visually stable while the camera distance and projection scale change together. A cylinder, cone, triangular pyramid, and rotated variants sit behind the cube, making the dolly zoom effect visible."
msgstr "central cube の見た目の大きさを保ちながら、camera distance と projection scale を連動させます。cube の後方に cylinder、cone、triangular pyramid とその回転変体を置き、 dolly zoom effect を見やすくします。"

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:40
msgid "Smoke Tests"
msgstr "Smoke Test"

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:48
msgid "Use `--once` when validating the renderer in scripts or CI-like local checks."
msgstr "script や local check では `--once` を使うと infinite animation loop を避けられます。"

#: manual/tutorial/demo.md:50
msgid "Use `just record`, `just export-image`, and `just show-image` for the default sequence and static-image workflows under the ignored `target/` directory."
msgstr "default sequence と static-image workflow には `just record`、`just export-image`、`just show-image` を使います。output は ignored `target/` に置かれます。"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend.md:1
msgid "Frontend Tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/frontend.md:16
msgid "Backends consume `draw_list` and decide how to rasterize or serialize it. `build_draw_list` also applies the scene's directional-light shadow map before writing each triangle intensity."
msgstr "backend は `draw_list` を消費し、rasterize または serialize の方法を決めます。 `build_draw_list` は各 triangle intensity を出力する前に scene の directional-light shadow map を適用します。"

#: manual/tutorial/view.md:1
msgid "View Tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/view.md:15
msgid "Use `OrthographicProjection` when depth should not affect projected size. Rasterizers should pass triangle barycentric weights to `interpolate_perspective_depth` instead of linearly interpolating perspective depth."
msgstr "depth による size change が不要な場合は `OrthographicProjection` を使います。 rasterizer は perspective depth を線形補間せず、triangle の barycentric weights を `interpolate_perspective_depth` に渡します。"

